  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue of knowledge and practices strengthening the autonomy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen URACCAN as a community-based intercultural university in addressing the historical rights deficits and contribute to the autonomy of the Caribbean multi-ethnic society. Intercultural courses, curriculum development and research, strategic planning, quality accreditation, language revitalization, student mobilization, community support, virtual learning and advocacy are the main lines of action of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
